00:22:33.610 --> 00:22:35.790
So what would happen is the machine
would just get slower and

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:37.900
slower and more software-like.

00:22:37.900 --> 00:22:40.970
More like a Turing machine and
usually they could fix it before

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:43.370
