00:33:49.930 --> 00:33:54.860
So the first thing, was just picking
an idea that's worth dedicating your life,

00:33:54.860 --> 00:33:55.810
if necessary to.

00:33:58.260 --> 00:34:01.970
So, this stuff was human destiny,

00:34:01.970 --> 00:34:06.870
fixing big human problems,
like we can't think very well.

00:34:06.870 --> 00:34:08.790
We need to make things
to help us to think,

00:34:08.790 --> 00:34:12.400
we need to make things
to help us cooperate.

00:34:12.400 --> 00:34:16.990
So these were save the world kind of ideas
and they were done when the Russians where

00:34:16.990 --> 00:34:24.090
