things did not look so good.

00:34:24.090 --> 00:34:25.110
Forget about goals,

00:34:26.900 --> 00:34:31.490
the problem is that goals tend to be much
more idiosyncratic to individual humans.

00:34:33.290 --> 00:34:35.330
So research wants to be a vision.

00:34:35.330 --> 00:34:38.664
So notice there aren't any
goals in the ARPA dream.

