because the same time the mouse was
invented this was done at Rand.

00:47:49.464 --> 00:47:51.215
And how did the Rand people go about it,

00:47:51.215 --> 00:47:55.250
well at midnight they will go through
people's waste paper baskets.

00:47:55.250 --> 00:47:59.190
To see how they worked,
what were they throwing away?

00:47:59.190 --> 00:48:02.090
And what people were doing when
they were working was making all

00:48:02.090 --> 00:48:05.290
kinds of diagrams and
little flowcharts and all this stuff.

00:48:05.290 --> 00:48:08.521
So they said, okay,
well let's invent the first tablet,

00:48:09.925 --> 00:48:13.940
As good as most of the tablets
you've ever used today.

00:48:13.940 --> 00:48:18.890
It's the hallmark of these people is they
generally did it good enough and here's-

00:48:18.890 --> 00:48:20.970
&gt;&gt; You may start to edit the flow diagram.

00:48:22.190 --> 00:48:26.169
First we erase the flow arrow,
then move the connector out of the way, so

00:48:26.169 --> 00:48:28.204
that we may draw a box in it's place.

