00:49:59.992 --> 00:50:02.950
So it was a very exciting thing to do and,
of course,

00:50:02.950 --> 00:50:06.890
one of the hardest things was to do
good head positioning back then.

00:50:06.890 --> 00:50:08.910
There are many ways of doing it.

